birefnet-int8.lwt — background removal model for Omniweave's "고품질(사람·동물)" option

Source:   BiRefNet by ZhengPeng7 (https://github.com/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet), official release v1,
          BiRefNet-general-bb_swin_v1_tiny-epoch_232.onnx (224,005,088 bytes)
          https://github.com/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/releases/download/v1/BiRefNet-general-bb_swin_v1_tiny-epoch_232.onnx
Changes:  converted by Omniweave's scripts/convert-birefnet.mjs to its own LWT1 graph format; weights quantized to
          int8 per output channel; batch normalisation folded into the preceding convolutions; the final 1x1
          convolution folded into the two 3x3 convolutions before it. No retraining.
File:     birefnet-int8.lwt, 46,082,436 bytes,
